<title>MALAYSIA: Khong Guan stock suspended for news.</title>
<headline>Khong Guan stock suspended for news.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Khong Guan Holdings (M) Bhd were suspended on Thursday pending a company announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Shares of the company, which is in property investment, management services and biscuit making, closed on Wednesday at 24.80 ringgit.</p>
<p>Company officials could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
